                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mfalme akasema, Na mwana wa bwana wako yuko wapi? Siba akamwambia mfalme, Angalia, anakaa Yerusalemu; kwani alisema, Leo nyumba ya Israeli watanirudishia ufalme wa babu yangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
