        {
          "text": " Ndipo mfalme akamwambia Siba, Tazama, yote yaliyokuwa ni mali ya Mefiboshethi ni yako. Siba akasema, Mimi ninasujudu; na nione kibali machoni pako, Ee bwana wangu, mfalme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.4",
