                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ndipo Abishai mwana wa Seruya, akamwambia mfalme, Mbona mbwa mfu huyu amlaani mfalme bwana wangu? Na nivuke, nakusihi, nikaondoe kichwa chake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.9",
