              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akamwambia Abishai, na watumishi wake wote, Angalieni, huyu mwanangu, aliyetoka viunoni mwangu, anautafuta uhai wangu; sembuse Mbenyamini huyu? Mwacheni alaani, kwa sababu BWANA ndiye aliyemwagiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.16.11"
            ]
