        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa, Hushai, Mwarki, rafiki wa Daudi, alipomjia Absalomu, Hushai akamwambia Absalomu, Na aishi mfalme, aishi mfalme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.16.16",
